"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303088_957623573304659_6012360513706127688_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bKRlK7TveHgQ7kNvwHN1coi&_nc_oc=Adr24VNau9YUFC4E3RZRV9jJOvHUgsYiSLOqttw6DvTyefzH8aFfQnjxc8veAJEEeeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLtufn5-gTuflegL2ng3absoOuYYCVOKCDBh936II7ZtQ&oe=6A9FFE2D"}, {"file_name": "Biology Dissections_1_Hero Cover.png", "id": "925014507102143", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298150_925014513768809_6320789418909777684_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ezJOZZHN_cwQ7kNvwG3gm8p&_nc_oc=AdrZvHAbEe6uJXN-kwwMs0kpgrz8lh1r2R-VqYStnMb6_qdJwZw2dcq0zbG_54ae5gY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI3Y1dK2HCFqzUxs4lBhzWEFYdNTmNAmLtLqcf4QsQZJg&oe=6A9FFDEC"}]}, "id": "1241930794597503", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Biology Dissections-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1218998130119020", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292779_1218998133452353_781282364801287801_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e4yKvGPl98IQ7kNvwEoVdiB&_nc_oc=AdrH6JqpoQQi_wKgsaxXwCydemw2sOmAcQX9p8tfE6ROGQnKvfUQtzu70ykFX8XsULw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkQM478Fes-C-xiCwp044U0oW4MCDblosIIi7ivxzAPg&oe=6A9FFCFA"}, {"file_name": "Biology Dissections-Screenshot-02.png", "id": "1754833001891573", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294603_1754833005224906_8262049022047381263_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZDTCQGq1fC8Q7kNvwFsvbgu&_nc_oc=Adq6njxHgKRZp6eNeS2L-HjBEA4hcpyjeaw9VUjavAEHkpP18IMOjub-gJnrLNyzncw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIJ-2saGDQ8qxGEYbMYe9ceoQdFS7grmK9WVIxeIb1exA&oe=6AA01EC7"}, {"file_name": "Biology Dissections-Screenshot-03.png", "id": "971088208759035", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307954_971088212092368_628615327949838979_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qVFS8TrleJIQ7kNvwEY7x8n&_nc_oc=AdoJzDfMko65DDQGZ1HktPqqbrptECRVBVEUdZd5nsO7LI7g-rjTL6e1ytEk9cBaALM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLOO9gx4ayy5sztr0i0pwzAP4xu3shCwAWSmr42h1GvKg&oe=6AA0240E"}, {"file_name": "Biology Dissections-Screenshot-04.png", "id": "1488093426033009", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307954_1488093429366342_5092250410859917268_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FBOThTybSQ4Q7kNvwEHjKjK&_nc_oc=AdpVjFCxu2JffCQ2ydzbfdCniS8QIj1VzPRRftpdvgV-H7UGlyHcAQBsnnkpY1EQB5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKjkJR761iUJo36jfWTNmRrkS6Q_ipAKx9wWAGPJIffCQ&oe=6AA00B2D"}, {"file_name": "Biology Dissections-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "1906072113403270", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298212_1906072116736603_4086204432800042966_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UovbX-4PKqwQ7kNvwHW6FqK&_nc_oc=Adq9fSOCE6sE7ch4G71EidI3QKNLmQHw4GXSgz79yzg1y743pjakm8w47hVYNTW-HAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLrciNMVJhwZ5bovXdMBBeDkfvSUs11VyICe62c4R_gqg&oe=6AA019E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Biology Dissections", "keywords": ["Biology", "Dissections", "Anatomy", "STEM", "Science"], "long_description": "**Biology Dissections** is an immersive VR biology experience designed to make anatomy exploration and dissection more accessible, engaging, and repeatable. The base app includes interactive overviews of the major body systems for all five specimens\u2014**WORM, CLAM, CRAYFISH, PERCH**, and **FROG**\u2014allowing students to study anatomy before entering a guided lab experience.\n\nThe base purchase also includes the full worm dissection, where learners can practice proper incision techniques, identify key anatomical structures, and build confidence using realistic virtual instruments such as scissors, forceps, and scalpels.\n\nAdditional specimens can be unlocked through optional add-ons. Users may purchase each remaining animal individually\u2014**CLAM, CRAYFISH, PERCH**, or **FROG**\u2014 or unlock all four together in a **discounted bundle**.\n\nBy removing the challenges associated with physical specimens, including cost, storage, preparation, and limited availability, Biology Dissections expands access to high-quality biology learning. Students can practice safely, independently, and as often as needed, whether in the classroom or beyond.\n\nSupports full **hand tracking** and Meta Quest controllers. Available in **English and Spanish.**", "short_description": "Explore anatomy in VR with interactive system overviews for 5 specimens\u2014WORM, CLAM, CRAYFISH, PERCH, and FROG\u2014and perform the FULL WORM DISSECTION in the base app. Unlock the remaining specimens individually or get the full 4-specimen pack. Safe, immersive, and repeatable biology learning. Supports hand tracking and Meta Quest controllers."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4374675976110951", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Biology Dissections", "keywords": ["Biologia", "Ciencia", "STEM", "Anatom\u00eda", "Disecci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "**Biology Dissections** es una experiencia inmersiva en VR dise\u00f1ada para hacer que la exploraci\u00f3n anat\u00f3mica y la disecci\u00f3n sean m\u00e1s accesibles, atractivas y repetibles. La aplicaci\u00f3n base incluye vistas generales interactivas de los principales sistemas del cuerpo de los cinco espec\u00edmenes: **GUSANO, ALMEJA, CANGREJO DE R\u00cdO, PEZ PERCA y RANA**, permitiendo a los estudiantes estudiar la anatom\u00eda antes de entrar a una experiencia guiada de disecci\u00f3n.\n\nLa compra base tambi\u00e9n incluye la disecci\u00f3n completa del GUSANO, donde los usuarios pueden practicar t\u00e9cnicas correctas de incisi\u00f3n, identificar estructuras anat\u00f3micas clave y desarrollar confianza usando instrumentos virtuales realistas como tijeras, pinzas y bistur\u00ed.\n\nLos dem\u00e1s espec\u00edmenes pueden desbloquearse mediante complementos opcionales. Es posible comprar de forma individual **ALMEJA, CANGREJO DE R\u00cdO, PEZ PERCA o RANA**, o desbloquear los cuatro en un **PAQUETE CON DESCUENTO**.\n\nAl eliminar los desaf\u00edos asociados con los espec\u00edmenes f\u00edsicos, como el costo, el almacenamiento, la preparaci\u00f3n y la disponibilidad limitada, **Biology Dissections** ampl\u00eda el acceso a una educaci\u00f3n de biolog\u00eda de alta calidad. Los estudiantes pueden practicar de forma segura, independiente y tantas veces como lo necesiten, dentro o fuera del aula.\n\nCompatible con **seguimiento de manos** completo y controladores Meta Quest. Disponible en **ingl\u00e9s y espa\u00f1ol.**", "short_description": "Explora la anatom\u00eda en VR con vistas interactivas de los sistemas de 5 espec\u00edmenes\u2014GUSANO, ALMEJA, CANGREJO DE R\u00cdO, PEZ PERCA y RANA\u2014y realiza la DISECCI\u00d3N COMPLETA DEL GUSANO en la app base. Desbloquea los espec\u00edmenes restantes por separado o consigue el paquete completo de 4. Aprendizaje de biolog\u00eda seguro, inmersivo y repetible. Compatible con hand tracking y controles Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://qrstudioai.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://qrstudioai.com/terms", "publisher_name": "QR Studio LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://qrstudioai.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection